I'd leave it in a stash somewhere and forget about it.  It isn't like
you need to be obsessively careful about it; just make sure the square
it's on is Elbereth'ed (and a container would be a bonus; you should
have your stash in a container anyway though).  You don't need to like
put it in a locked chest in a pit and then fill the pit and burn
Elbereth on all the surrounding squares and then get the room covered
in water somehow, but don't be stupid either.  The thing to remember is
that even if somebody finds it, it's not the end of the world or
anything and you can just kill them for it.

